# COMPOSE_PWD_INTERP — ${POSTGRES_PASSWORD} interpolation inside
# command:/entrypoint: blocks of docker-compose*.yml.
#
# Format (mirrors tools/lint/.no_fail_open_return.baseline):
#   <file>:<lineno><TAB or two-or-more-spaces><reason>
#
# Adding an entry REQUIRES a written reason that references a triage
# ticket, audit finding, or roadmap item — entries without one are
# rejected at lint-startup so the allowlist stays auditable.
#
# The target state of this file is empty: every entry should either
# (a) get fixed (move the DSN composition into the service entrypoint
# script — see scripts/mlflow_entrypoint.sh for the reference shape),
# or (b) be removed once the upstream fix lands.
#
# Initial baseline 2026-05-27: empty. R8-12 v2 (PR #24) and Phase 0-B
# (PR #28) already moved the last two trap sites (mlflow + postgres-
# exporter) into their entrypoint scripts.
